OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,6,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,7,Fsome bright or sunny spells. Brisk
OL,8,Fsouthwesterly winds across Edinburgh
OL,9,Fand Lothian.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with
OL,12,Fsome light brightness. Then the rest
OL,13,Fof the night will be dry will be dry
OL,14,Fwith variable amounts of cloud.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FMostly cloudy with a few
OL,17,Fbright or sunny spells. Mainly dry but
OL,18,Foccasional rain may affect West
OL,19,FLothian later in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
